#EXTM3U
#PLAYLIST:Bitdance
# A tour of sehnsucht with one track per supported format. Each entry carries
# a theme= tag that fits its mood, so one pass shows all three visualizers
# and all six themes. IMF and AudioT rate= tags use the original game tick
# rates (VGMPF). AudioT, KSM, ROL, SCI0, and XMI fetch their companion files
# from the same directory.

